  note    strings with C's escapes; a string with a line break inside is written across lines as msgcat writes it, every string otherwise on one line (msgcat wraps at 79 columns)

capability gettext/catalog  a catalog built and changed in memory
  heroes  i18n.new_catalog, i18n.add_message, i18n.new_message, i18n.Catalog, i18n.Message
  go      catalog.NewBuilder, catalog.NewFromMap, catalog.Dictionary, catalog.Fallback, message.DefaultCatalog, message.Catalog, message.NewPrinter
  rust    -
  python  NullTranslations, NullTranslations.info, NullTranslations.charset
  java    ListResourceBundle, ListResourceBundle.getContents, PropertyResourceBundle
  dotnet  ResourceSet, ResourceReader, ResourceWriter
  odin    i18n.Translation, i18n.destroy
  note    `add_message` copies the catalog's list; a large catalog is built by `new_catalog`

capability gettext/plural-forms  a header's Plural-Forms read and run safely
  heroes  i18n.parse_plural_forms, i18n.plural_index, i18n.PluralForms
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  gettext.c2py
  java    -
  dotnet  -
  odin    -
  icu     -
  note    parsed by a shunting yard and run by an explicit stack, so a nesting the file chooses never reaches the program's stack; at most 100 deep and 10,000 bytes; `&&`, `||` and `?:` short-circuit as C does; overflow, a division by zero or a subtraction below zero fails, where C's unsigned numbers wrap

capability gettext/header  a field of a catalog's header
